ly 1 each remaining)\n\nReason: W8 is the safest and most logical discard. It's completely isolated in my hand with no tiles nearby to form a sequence (W7 has 0 unshown, W9 has 0 unshown). All three other W8 tiles are still unshown, making it relatively safe to discard. Keeping T1-T1-T2 and T6-T7-T7 gives me better sequence potential, as T3 has 3 copies unshown. Keeping B1-B1-B2 also maintains the possibility of forming B1-B2-B3 with 2 B3 tiles remaining.\n\nAnswer: Play W8"}
